Subject: [PATCH] Apply high-confidence historical corrections from the data
 audit

Wrestler corrections (js/data.js):
- Alignments: Hulk Hogan face (until the nWo turn), Booker T heel
  (Harlem Heat), Mabel/Mo face (MOM)
- Contracts matched to real 1995 movements: Vader + Steve Austin 35w
  noRenew (fired mid/late 1995), Jeff Jarrett 27w (left July 1995),
  Bam Bam Bigelow 43w noRenew (last WWF match Nov 19, 1995),
  British Bulldog 143w (WCW Dec 1997), Chris Benoit 34w and Shane
  Douglas 27w noRenew (ECW departures 1995)
- Sid moved to USWA (reigning USWA Unified champion, Jan 1995);
  Bobby Eaton to WCW; Bobby Blaze to SMW
- Goldust starter replaced by Dustin Rhodes (WCW babyface, 15w noRenew)
- Birth-year age fixes: Johnny B. Badd 34, Meng 35, Avalanche 31,
  Rocco Rock 41, Fatu 29, Hakushi 28, Adam Bomb 30, Rey Mysterio 20,
  Nakanishi 27, Duke Droese 26, Chris Candido 24

Free-agent / arrival corrections (js/data.js):
- Removed 12 incorrect January-1995 starters (duplicates of
  the-gladiator/avalanche/nakanishi/sione/kwang/rad-radford, and
  barry-windham/jim-neidhart/tom-brandi/missy-hyatt who were not under
  contract); kurasawa, rad-radford and phineas-godwinn re-added as
  dated FA arrivals (Oct 1995 / May 1995 / Aug 1995)
- Converted 8 not-yet-debuted starters to dated FA arrivals:
  the-renegade (t10), man-mountain-rock (t4), Blu Brothers (t8),
  jean-pierre-lafitte (t13), waylon-mercy (t24), disco-inferno (t34),
  mr-jl (t34); Eddy Guerrero to an ECW arrival t13 (he was NJPW/AAA
  talent until his April 8, 1995 ECW debut)
- Arrival-date fixes: Goldberg t131 (Sept 22, 1997), Kane t132
  (Oct 5, 1997), Shamrock t102, Val Venis t163, Sable t59
  (WrestleMania XII), Jacqueline t164, Lita t245, RVD t48
  (Jan 5, 1996), Jericho + Steiners t52, Hawk t16, Dean Douglas t27
- Added 8 missing major workers with dated arrivals: Kurt Angle
  (t233, Survivor Series 1999), Edge (t167, June 22, 1998), Christian
  (t179, Sept 27, 1998), Hardy Boyz (t144), D-Von Dudley (t61, ECW
  April 13, 1996), Mark Henry (t57, March 11, 1996), Rick Rude
  (t90, ECW November 1996)

test/sim.js: two assertions updated to the corrected data (Hogan's
starting alignment; custom-fed draft pick replaced with a starter who
still exists). Full suite passes; fresh game is 387 = 290 starters +
60 generated indies + 37 local jobbers; 150 indies by 2001; all new
arrivals verified to enter on schedule in a 300-week simulation.
